    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to do in Toybox Aces?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready your airplane, get into the air, and take down your enemies. Returning safely is optional\u2014as long as you complete your mission goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except... the airplane is a tiny toy plane, the arena is a kid\u2019s room, and things aren\u2019t quite what they seem for those with limited imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense air-to-air dogfights on an unprecedented scale. Use the environment to take cover, sneak up on opponents, and wreak havoc amidst ground targets\u2014all while keeping your airplane under control, a challenge even without enemy fire.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373080/extras/39bbb91e47e6bfc744a7ca711ae81f68.avif?t=1753905373\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you\u2019ll encounter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dogfights</strong>: This is what you\u2019re here for, right? Close-range air combat against other players, AI, or both.<br></li><li><strong>Air-to-Ground Combat</strong>: Destroy ground targets\u2014but don\u2019t be fooled, they usually bite back.<br></li><li><strong>Missions</strong>: There are jobs to do, and you\u2019re the one to do them.<br></li><li><strong>Races</strong>: Yes, races\u2014against other players, AI, or yourself, but always against the merciless stopwatch.<br></li><li><strong>Time Trial</strong>: More like target practice, where you can shine with your flight, shooting, and planning skills. Destroy targets against the clock and outpace your competition.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to do in Toybox Aces?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready your airplane, get into the air, and take down your enemies. Returning safely is optional\u2014as long as you complete your mission goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except... the airplane is a tiny toy plane, the arena is a kid\u2019s room, and things aren\u2019t quite what they seem for those with limited imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense air-to-air dogfights on an unprecedented scale. Use the environment to take cover, sneak up on opponents, and wreak havoc amidst ground targets\u2014all while keeping your airplane under control, a challenge even without enemy fire.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373080/extras/39bbb91e47e6bfc744a7ca711ae81f68.avif?t=1753905373\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you\u2019ll encounter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dogfights</strong>: This is what you\u2019re here for, right? Close-range air combat against other players, AI, or both.<br></li><li><strong>Air-to-Ground Combat</strong>: Destroy ground targets\u2014but don\u2019t be fooled, they usually bite back.<br></li><li><strong>Missions</strong>: There are jobs to do, and you\u2019re the one to do them.<br></li><li><strong>Races</strong>: Yes, races\u2014against other players, AI, or yourself, but always against the merciless stopwatch.<br></li><li><strong>Time Trial</strong>: More like target practice, where you can shine with your flight, shooting, and planning skills. Destroy targets against the clock and outpace your competition.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fast paced, action loaded, physics based, close air combat game with a twist: Instead of soaring through the skies, you fly a tiny toy plane, wreaking havoc in the kids room and beyond.",
